  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a pan over medium heat.",
    "2. Place the tortilla in the pan and cook for 1-2 minutes.",
    "3. Add the Uruguayan ham to the tortilla and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "4. Sprinkle the cheddar cheese on top of the ham.",
    "5. Fold the tortilla in half to enclose the filling.",
